//! Generated by `cargo run --example repro -- <input> --emit stopping_child_settles_before_order`.
//!
//! Was: harness false positive (fixed in the harness): `V9: supervisor children did not stop in reverse declaration order`.
//! A supervised child was stopped just before an ordered supervisor
//! shutdown. Under the canonical schedule the quiescing driver yielded and
//! was picked again at once, so the child had not run its stop yet and was
//! counted as running. Quiescing now sleeps (the simulator runs every other
//! ready task before a timer fires).
//! Strategy dfs:bound=0, seed 14599046013261342934.
//!
